# Test-run output: logs, screenshots and reports, rewritten on every sweep.
# The harness recreates all of it, so none of it belongs in history.
lab/out/

# Anything generated during a run rather than authored.
lab/generated/

# Credentials. There are none in the tree today and there should never be:
# the API key is read from an environment variable, and on Cloud Run it is
# injected from Secret Manager. See README.md.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*-key.json
service-account*.json

# An empty stray folder.
Pink Petal Closet/

# OS and editor noise.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node is not used to build or run this — there are no dependencies — but keep
# this here so an accidental `npm install` cannot land in a commit.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Working material, deliberately not shared as code:
#
#   form_answers.md   answers drafted for a submission form — private notes,
#                     not part of the project.
#   Pink_Petal_Closet_Documentation.md
#                     the FIRST draft of the documentation. It describes a
#                     pre-rendered "3D mannequin" feature that was removed, so
#                     committing it would put a document in the repo that
#                     contradicts the code. Documentation1.md is the current one.
form_answers.md
Pink_Petal_Closet_Documentation.md

# Generated from Pink_Petal_Closet_Documentation1.md by the md-to-docx script,
# purely so Google Docs can import it. Not a source file.
Pink_Petal_Closet_Documentation1.docx
